      "extract": "According to the principle of black hole complementarity [1], an observer who remains outside the horizon of a black hole can describe the black hole as a very hot membrane, the stretched horizon, which lies just above the mathematical event horizon, and absorbs any matter, energy, and information which fall onto it. The information which is absorbed by the stretched horizon is eventually re-emitted in the Hawking",
